"""Standalone landing page for kfescapes.thethinkthank.com -- restyled onto the
Singapore Airlines corporate palette (Midnight Royal Blue / California Gold) per the
brand guide the user supplied, deliberately NOT following the Stroll & Savor / Field
Notes brand system used elsewhere on this site. Served via functions/index.js's
host-based routing (this file's render() output is written to
site/dist/_kfescapes-landing/index.html by build.py, which the Function fetches for
requests with Host: kfescapes.thethinkthank.com).

Does not reproduce Singapore Airlines' actual "Bird of Gold" logo artwork or their
proprietary batik pattern -- uses a generic decorative motif and a typographic homage
to their wordmark case treatment instead, plus a clear independence disclaimer in the
footer, since this page's visual identity closely evokes theirs.

The JS data arrays and rendering logic below are copied verbatim from the same source
file as krisflyer_dashboard_2026_10.py via a scripted transform (not hand-edited) --
regenerate from an updated source file each month rather than hand-editing flight
numbers, miles, dates, or blackout data here.
"""

